name: Diagram context is evidence-bound, budgeted and inactive through restart
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/dfd_context.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
submit: setg ui.auto_open_viz false
submit: run threat-model:import {"path":".kuzushi/manual-context.json","label":"Beta","activate":true}
require-live-snap: 30 threat-model:import saved | active-beta
submit: map
require-live-snap: 25 SYSTEM SUMMARY | beta-map
nav-mode:
keys: u
require-live-snap: 25 Map ✓ | accepted-beta
keys: Tab z
require-live-snap: 20 g plan context | diagram-action
keys: g
require-live-snap: 20 repository file evidence | missing-evidence
keys: Escape
nav-mode:
keys: Down g
require-live-snap: 20 PLAN EVIDENCE CONTEXT | beta-plan-only
expect: One full architecture draft
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 LEAVE UNSAVED STUDY | explicit-leave
keys: d
require-live-snap: 20 g plan context | returned-beta-diagram
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/dfd_context.py @TMP_TARGET @ART navigation
submit: scan batch
require-live-snap: 20 PLAN A STUDY | parent-study
keys: Enter
type: 5
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 5 passes · 1 worker(s) | parent-five-passes
keys: Down Down Down Enter Up Enter
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT SUMMARY | inspected-inactive-alpha
expect: Alpha
keys: v Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 COMPONENT · Alpha receiver | selected-alpha-context
keys: g
require-live-snap: 20 PLAN EVIDENCE CONTEXT | alpha-context-plan
expect: 2 exact evidence files
expect: " app /lib.py"
expect: Dollar estimate unavailable
keys: t
type: 9
keys: Enter r
type: 2
keys: Enter
resize: 160x48
wait: 0.5
live-snap: plan-160x48
resize: 96x89
wait: 0.5
live-snap: plan-96x89
resize: 80x24
wait: 0.5
live-snap: plan-80x24
resize: 60x20
wait: 0.5
live-snap: plan-60x20
resize: 40x12
wait: 0.5
live-snap: plan-40x12
expect: 2 files · 1 job · 1 attempt
expect: Calls: 9 max · 2 for Review
expect: Dollar estimate unavailable
expect: openai-oauth:gpt-5.5 · medium
expect: M model
expect: s retention
keys: NPage
live-snap: plan-reader-40x12-middle
keys: NPage
live-snap: plan-paths-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: plan-omissions-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: plan-budget-40x12
keys: NPage NPage NPage
live-snap: plan-reader-40x12-last
ask: Can an operator distinguish selected source excerpts, inherited architecture, one full context job, shared limits, unknown dollars and separate approval at all six sizes?
resize: 120x36
wait: 0.5
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 LEAVE UNSAVED STUDY | keep-unsaved-choice
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 PLAN EVIDENCE CONTEXT | kept-plan
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 Draft ready | frozen-context-job
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/dfd_context.py @TMP_TARGET @ART draft
keys: Enter End
require-live-snap: 30 y approve | approve-one-context-job
expect: 1 fixed jobs
expect: Threat context: inherited
expect: Evidence: 2 exact files
keys: y
require-live-snap: 30 Open approved context job | approved
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 L starts the approved jobs | fixed-job
keys: L
require-live-snap: 30 dispatcher pid | launched
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/dfd_context.py @TMP_TARGET @ART completed
keys: r
require-live-snap: 30 Jobs: 1 · 1 completed | completed
keys: a
require-live-snap: 30 EVIDENCE CONTEXT DRAFT | reviewed-result
expect: 1 committed / 9
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 CONTEXT SUMMARY | inspected-inactive-result
expect: Draft evidence reader
keys: d
require-live-snap: 25 Before: | inherited-text-comparison
expect: After:
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT SUMMARY | comparison-return
keys: NPage NPage
live-snap: frozen-evidence-receipt
keys: Escape Escape
require-live-snap: 25 COMPONENT · Alpha receiver | original-diagram-restored
ask: Does Back restore the original selected inactive context and parent draft after generation, while the generated context remains a separate inactive choice?
keys: Escape Escape
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | original-parent-draft
expect: 5 passes · 1 worker(s)
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME NO_COLOR=1 KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/dfd-context-resume.txt
keys: Enter
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 30 EVIDENCE CONTEXT DRAFT | recovered-result
expect: 1 committed / 9
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 CONTEXT SUMMARY | recovered-exact-context
expect: Draft evidence reader
keys: NPage NPage
live-snap: recovered-evidence-receipt
ask: Does restart preserve the exact generated revision, frozen evidence and inheritance receipt, one spent call and inactive status without claiming live inference or complete repository coverage?
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/dfd_context.py @TMP_TARGET @ART recovered
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
